10:56.473 --> 10:59.135
[SPEAKER_01]: There's no way to get around Linux being just extremely big.

11:00.496 --> 11:12.025
[SPEAKER_01]: And you can kind of get around the fact that Linux is very big by going ahead and sharing your operating system environment, sharing your operating system with other threads on a machine.

11:12.593 --> 11:16.815
