11:27.439 --> 11:34.642
[SPEAKER_01]: I am thinking that Unikernels might be closer to Zen performance-wise than Containers.

11:36.725 --> 11:46.288
[SPEAKER_01]: Or, sorry, might be closer to, like, unikurtles are obviously, my guess is that both, like, unikurtles are somewhere between bubble wrap and containers in performance.

11:46.668 --> 11:47.548
