14:39.283 --> 14:46.365
[SPEAKER_00]: The way that it's like the thinking fast and slow duality idea and LLM is thinking hyper slow.

14:46.825 --> 14:47.505
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

14:47.545 --> 14:57.168
[SPEAKER_01]: Especially like, Oh, is it in the context of, but there's also like another important thing, which is that, um, in AI system, like you kind of can't run it in any way, like

14:58.075 --> 15:04.040
[SPEAKER_01]: Your LLM inference, and I think it's kind of important to really think about, well, how does your inference logic kind of relate to your modeling system?

15:04.400 --> 15:09.243
[SPEAKER_01]: The way that a LLM inference system works is, first off, you kind of need to have a network barrier there.

15:10.804 --> 15:17.549
