15:33.813 --> 15:39.135
[SPEAKER_01]: So you have your CPU system, which is kind of like your environment that the agents are doing their stuff in.

15:39.651 --> 15:42.834
[SPEAKER_01]: And then you have the GPU system, which is actually computing the neural weights for the agents.

15:43.074 --> 15:43.254
